## Third-Party Code Notice

This project contains code derived from **Microsoft Windows Server 2003 `cmd.exe`** source code (originally leaked in 2004, now publicly archived). The original Windows `cmd.exe` source code is copyright Microsoft Corporation. This port contains substantial modifications for POSIX/Termux compatibility.

The Windows CE 6.0 `cmd.exe` source (CMD2) was referenced for algorithmic inspiration during development (path parsing, wildcard handling, builtin implementations). No CE code was directly copied.

All POSIX shim layer code (`portable/` directory) is original work written for this port.